\documentclass{article}
\newcommand{\dataset}{WikiTalk-40k}
\begin{document}
\section{Data}
We release \dataset, a corpus of moderated discussions. \dataset contains 40k threads.
\section{Experiments}
Models fine-tuned on \dataset outperform zero-shot baselines. The \dataset test split is strictly temporal. All results use \dataset version 1.2.
\end{document}

